7,204,181,252,45,156,127,114,188,0,0,0,0,73,69,78,68,174,66,96,130],"annotations":[{"id":"1775580229555","neuronKeys":["[#b3221]","[#4cfb2]","[#649b2]","[#08ee4]"],"edgeStrings":[],"description":"These are our inputs for dance moves! We use the d-pad from a game controller, but each neuron can be bound just as easily to keys from your keyboard!","thumbnail":""},{"id":"1775580302840","neuronKeys":["[#4cfb2]","[#78b71]","[#c760b]","[#0d51b]"],"edgeStrings":["[#4cfb2]_#_[#78b71]","[#78b71]_#_[#4cfb2]","[#78b71]_#_[#dddca]","[#dddca]_#_[#0d51b]","[#dddca]_#_[#c760b]","[#c760b]_#_[#0d51b]","[#0d51b]_#_[#4cfb2]","[#0d51b]_#_[#78b71]"],"description":"When we press right on the Dpad, we activate a Fixed Action Pattern. This will step through a sequence and SpikerBot will shuffle to the right.","thumbnail":""},{"id":"1775580397755","neuronKeys":["[#08ee4]","[#a8790]","[#d71ea]","[#dd652]","[#5342f]"],"edgeStrings":["[#08ee4]_#_[#a8790]","[#a8790]_#_[#08ee4]","[#a8790]_#_[#5342f]","[#5342f]_#_[#d71ea]","[#dd652]_#_[#d71ea]","[#5342f]_#_[#dd652]","[#d71ea]_#_[#a8790]","[#d71ea]_#_[#08ee4]"],"description":"When pressing left, SpikerBot will shuffle to the left. Check out the Fixed Action Pattern brain in the examples to learn how this network functions in depth!","thumbnail":""},{"id":"1775580478326","neuronKeys":["[#b3221]"],"edgeStrings":["[#b3221]_#_[#3391e]","[#b3221]_#_[#326e3]","[#b3221]_#_[#395bd]"],"description":"Pressing up on the d-pad will move SpikerBot forward, and speaks an affirmative ‘Mhmm!’ As it gets into the groove.","thumbnail":""},{"id":"1775580545658","neuronKeys":["[#649b2]"],"edgeStrings":["[#649b2]_#_[#326e3]","[#649b2]_#_[#f3f93]","[#649b2]_#_[#2301b]"],"description":"Pressing down will spin SpikerBot to reorient it for the next dance moves!","thumbnail":""},{"id":"1775580646552","neuronKeys":["[#4cfb2]","[#78b71]","[#dddca]","[#0d51b]","[#c760b]","[#08ee4]","[#a8790]","[#d71ea]","[#dd652]","[#5342f]"],"edgeStrings":["[#4cfb2]_#_[#78b71]","[#78b71]_#_[#4cfb2]","[#78b71]_#_[#dddca]","[#dddca]_#_[#0d51b]","[#0d51b]_#_[#4cfb2]","[#0d51b]_#_[#78b71]","[#c760b]_#_[#0d51b]","[#dddca]_#_[#c760b]","[#a8790]_#_[#08ee4]","[#08ee4]_#_[#a8790]","[#d71ea]_#_[#08ee4]","[#d71ea]_#_[#a8790]","[#5342f]_#_[#d71ea]","[#dd652]_#_[#d71ea]","[#5342f]_#_[#dd652]","[#a8790]_#_[#5342f]"],"description":"Can you imagine any other dance moves that spikerBot can do using other buttons, or executing other patterns? What will happen when we make multiple dance moves happen at once?","thumbnail":""}],"info":{"title":"Remote Control Dancer","description":"Slide to the left, slide to the right, spin and more all with remote control!","author":"User","version":"1.0.1","timestamp":"2026-04-08T16:03:04.174922"}}